{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213090","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421309001:1":{"text":"ゴクゴクゴク……う、うめえ……やっぱ酒はうめえなあ！","source_cn":"咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟……酒……好酒，哈哈哈，好酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x349FF955E6D41E01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421309002:1":{"text":"ちゃんと酒を飲ませてやったんだ、次はこっちの質問に答えてもらうぞ。","source_cn":"行了！现在喝到酒了，能回答我们的问题了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE9B93503630046","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421309003:1":{"text":"真っ昼間に仕事もせず、坑道の中で飲んだくれてるなんて、一体どういう了見だ！？","source_cn":"大白天的，你不去干活，还在宝贵的矿洞里酗酒，是想干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD9EFB1AE746200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421309004:1":{"text":"ち、違っ……俺はただ……か、悲しんでたんだ！貴重なオルデナイトに、胸を痛めてたんだよ！","source_cn":"酗……酗酒？我不是酗酒！我这是……哀、哀悼！为了宝贵的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27BD4E5DD5EDA773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421309005:1":{"text":"ちびっ子のおめえは見たことねえだろうな。オルデナイトはまさに百年物の名酒！触れてると、魂まで穏やかになるのさ……","source_cn":"小丫头，你没见过深岩晶吧？它就像是，百年的陈酿！抚摸着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95BE63B29E62B082","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421309006:1":{"text":"それに比べて、ここの鉄鉱石は、おめえらが持ってきたこの酒と同じ、ウンコも同然だ！","source_cn":"相比之下，这里的铁矿，那就像是，你们拿给我的这、这种酒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93F874C01559DC5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421309007:1":{"text":"さっきまでそれを飲んでたくせに、言ってて気持ち悪くないのか……？","source_cn":"你自己说自己喝的东西，都不嫌恶心吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC08FCF939A3AF6AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421309008:1":{"text":"へっ、オルデナイトを失った痛みに比べたら、全然気にならねえよ……","source_cn":"哈哈哈，比不上失去深岩晶的痛苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x797E93870D168876","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421309009:1":{"text":"オルデナイトを一度知ってしまったら、他の鉱石なんざ、どれも劣悪品だ……","source_cn":"只要尝试过深岩晶，其他所有的，一切矿石，都是劣等品……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E1BCE68238C154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1421309009":{"text":"オルデナイトを一度知ってしまったら、他の鉱石なんざ、どれも劣悪品だ……","source_cn":"只要尝试过深岩晶，其他所有的，一切矿石，都是劣等品……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E1BCE68238C154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title